# BuildKit reads this in place of backend/.dockerignore when building
# Dockerfile.migrations. Allowlist, not denylist: nothing reaches the context
# unless a COPY below names it, so a new directory in backend/ cannot drift in.
*

!.python-version
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!alembic/**
!app/**
!scripts/**
!data/seed/**

**/__pycache__
**/__pycache__/**
*.pyc
